{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21083","headline":"偶书 · 刘叉","name":"偶书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出扶桑一丈高，人间万事细如毛。\n野夫怒见不平处，磨损胸中万古刀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘叉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷三九一、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》刘叉条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）"}